    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Black Cat Bundle! A world of magic, wonder, and throwing all of your money away! This 2D arcade platformer consists of two game modes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Black Cat Blitz</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab chips, avoid obstacles, and reach a high score to show The Black Cat who's boss! You can either play alone or split the earnings with a buddy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Black Cat Brawl</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to prove to your friends that you truly are better at gambling than them? Here's your chance! Black Cat Brawl has you going up against 7 of your friends in a team-based slamfest!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overall Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 rounds with 8 unique locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 playable characters, each with their own unique move (can you recognize any?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 palettes per character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High score table</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faithful pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun in The Black Cat's game show! He's always watching...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Black Cat Bundle! A world of magic, wonder, and throwing all of your money away! This 2D arcade platformer consists of two game modes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Black Cat Blitz</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab chips, avoid obstacles, and reach a high score to show The Black Cat who's boss! You can either play alone or split the earnings with a buddy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Black Cat Brawl</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to prove to your friends that you truly are better at gambling than them? Here's your chance! Black Cat Brawl has you going up against 7 of your friends in a team-based slamfest!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overall Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 rounds with 8 unique locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 playable characters, each with their own unique move (can you recognize any?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 palettes per character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High score table</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faithful pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun in The Black Cat's game show! He's always watching...</p>",
    "short_description": "Black Cat Bundle is a 2D arcade platformer that consists of two games: Black Cat Blitz and Black Cat Brawl. Avoid obstacles and reach a high score either alone or with a buddy in Black Cat Blitz. Either that or grab seven of your friends and duke it out in the team-based showdown Black Cat Brawl!",
